# tileset v1 (LOCKED GATE 3) — vars: {region}, {materials}, {props}
# model: flux_2 pro 1k, aspect 1:1, medias: [region environment concept as reference]
# output is hand-cut into 16x16 tiles after postprocess.py --kind tilesheet
Pixel art game tileset sheet on a strict 16x16 pixel grid, organized in neat
rows, for the region: {region}. Materials: {materials}. Props: {props}.
Each tile self-contained and seamlessly tileable with its neighbors variants:
floor, wall top, wall face, platform edge, rail pair, stairs, two decorations.
GBA Pokemon FireRed tileset style matching the reference image's palette and
lighting, flat cel shading, crisp pixels, no gradients, limited palette.
Plain solid white background between tiles, no text, no watermark.
